#: kab_main.cc:51
msgid ""
"<qt>Version 2 of the KDE address book is not compatible with the previous one"
". To protect your address database, a new file will be used. Run <b>File->Imp"
"ort->KDE 1 addressbook</b> to use your old database with the new version.</qt"
">"
